  "observations": [
    "Desktop screenshots and sampled frames show a streamed Playground answer and the MCP add tool returning 42 on both revisions",
    "Phone portrait chat shows the generated answer, with the same clipped Send control, partially hidden prompt, horizontally scrolling navigation and overlapping Aria control on both revisions. Enter submits the chat",
    "The unchanged portrait MCP tool list collapses to zero-width labels. Both runs capture the limitation then rotate the touch viewport to 844x390 landscape to execute the add tool",
    "Landscape MCP screenshots show 42, with existing header crowding, a wide desktop sidebar and horizontal scrolling. No clean portrait MCP or general mobile usability claim is made",
    "Eight evenly sampled frames per recording were inspected using eight contact sheets. This is sampled visual inspection, not a claim of watching every video frame",
    "This backend fix changes callback logging. Successful UI results are compatibility controls and are not visual proof of the logging correction"
  ],
